+## Accomplishments
+- Question bank with 16 questions across 9 profile categories (identity, communication, cognitive_style, energy_patterns, values_and_motivation, emotional_landscape, work_patterns, neurodivergence, relationships) using OARS technique, narrative discovery, and values elicitation
+- Interview orchestration module that selects next question based on profile coverage gaps, respects phase ordering (warm_up -> current_state -> gap_identification -> commitment), and tracks answered questions via brain.events
+- CLAUDE.md onboarding section with 6 subsections: Starting, Conducting the Interview, Reciprocal Disclosure, Progressive Profiling, Channel Orchestration, and Design Principles
+- Human verification confirmed: onboarding interview works naturally, Claude captures stated and implied information, reciprocal disclosure feels genuine
