+## Decisions Made
+- Question bank covers 9 categories with 4-phase arc matching motivational interviewing structure (warm_up first, commitment last)
+- AI disclosure is optional per-question -- some questions have natural reciprocal moments, others don't need them
+- Interview module is purely a question selector; Claude conducts the actual conversation using CLAUDE.md behavioral instructions
+- Progressive profiling section teaches Claude to continue learning after the initial interview through observation (source="inferred", confidence=0.5)
+- Design principles (short bursts, auto-save, no shame framing, default everything) positioned as the standard interaction style
